# Use Yarn for All Commands

**ALWAYS** use `yarn` as the package manager. Never use `npm` or `npx`.

## Examples

```bash
# ✅ CORRECT
yarn install
yarn test
yarn lint
yarn add <package>

# ❌ INCORRECT
npm install
npm test
npm run lint
npx <command>
```
